## Measuring application performance[¶](https://docs.kanzi.com/4.1.0/en/working-with/application-configurations/application-configuration.html#measuring-application-performance "Link to this heading")
The Kanzi performance profiling system enables you to measure the performance of your Kanzi application. You can measure the performance of:
  * Different parts of Kanzi Engine during application startup and runtime. See [Measuring the performance of Kanzi Engine](https://docs.kanzi.com/4.1.0/en/working-with/performance-profiling/profiling-kanzi-engine.html).
  * Your Kanzi application code. See [Measuring the performance of your application code](https://docs.kanzi.com/4.1.0/en/working-with/performance-profiling/profiling-application-code.html).
  * Resource loading and deployment. See [Measuring the loading and deployment time of resources](https://docs.kanzi.com/4.1.0/en/working-with/performance-profiling/resource-profiling.html).


